# ============================================
# MyLibrarySystem — Whitelist-mode .gitignore
# Root README, library-frontend, and library-server are tracked.
# Everything else at the repo root is ignored.
# ============================================

# --- Ignore everything at repo root ---
*
/*

# --- Allow only these directories and this file ---
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!library-frontend/
!library-server/

# ============================================
# docs/ — baseline-only tracking
#
# docs/ is excluded from automatic tracking. Only files listed in
# docs/README.md "文档维护基线" are tracked, using `git add -f`.
# New documents must be added to the baseline BEFORE force-adding.
# 90-archive/ files are NON-normative and never tracked.
# ============================================
